# Mirrored SFR face art (tools/fetch_faces.py). Served locally by Vite so a local
# build shows the real dice, but never committed -- the repo stays free of their
# artwork, and the app falls back to our own glyphs when this is absent.
public/faces/
assets/faces/
# And the archive it arrives in, which `assets/faces/` does not cover -- one
# `git add -A` is all it would take to put their artwork in the history for good.
assets*.zip

# Temporary working plan for the phase in progress; folded into docs/PLAN-V1.md when it lands.
docs/PLAN-V1-Phase*.md
docs/PLAN-V2-Phase*.md

# The v4.02 rulebook: a local reference only. v4.01 stays the rules this project implements,
# and at 92 MB the newer book is not worth carrying in the history. See PLAN-V2.md, Phase 0.
docs/rules/V4.02 Dragon Dice rules.pdf

# Local reference images (species art and the like): a working reference only, never
# committed -- the same reason as public/faces/ above.
image_references/

# The terminal's saved run (v3 Phase 3, `npm run play -- --run`): one player's progress,
# never the project's.
.run-save.json
